{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41204","headline":"除夜长安作 · 李京","name":"除夜长安作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安朔风起，穷巷掩双扉。\n新岁明朝是，故乡何路归。\n鬓丝饶镜色，隙雪夺灯辉。\n却羡秦州雁，逢春尽北飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李京","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}